# COMPONENT

## CrudNestedValueSample

### PACKAGE

org.sample.crudnestedvalue

### DESCRIPTION

CRUD sample component for nested value object persistence.

### SPECIFICATION

This sample stays in the plain CRUD line.
It demonstrates one entity record that contains a value object, and that value object itself contains another value object.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

`Person` is the persisted `Entity`.
`Address` is a `Value Object` embedded inside `Person`.
`CountryCode` is a `Value Object` embedded inside `Address`.

# VALUE

## CountryCode

### DESCRIPTION

Leaf value object inside `Address`.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| value | string | 1            |

## Address

### DESCRIPTION

Address value object embedded inside `Person`.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type        | multiplicity |
|---------+-------------+--------------|
| street  | string      | 1            |
| city    | string      | 1            |
| country | CountryCode | 1            |

# ENTITY

## Person

### DESCRIPTION

Plain CRUD entity with nested value object attributes.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name    | type      | multiplicity |
|---------+-----------+--------------|
| id      | entityid  | 1            |
| name    | name      | 1            |
| address | Address   | 1            |

# SERVICE

## Person

### DESCRIPTION

Person-facing CRUD surface for nested value object persistence.
